  "chronology": "Buffer correction private history07:40:53 precedes formal finding filing07:43:24, and its first publication at5156 was08:25:04. This supplement verifies already-correct buffers without inventing a new payload event or backdating formal filing. Parent NEW01 worker report precedes its private candidate selection while formal GitHub filing follows; exact actual times and later interpretation changes are retained in receipts. Historical primary capture times and authors are not reauthored.",
  "current_scientific_conclusions": [
    "Whole nominal HEPES/Tris stocks have no unsupported speciation/moiety parts or paired assertion; stockstrength/sourcepH/quantities remain distinct from dry salt and receiving-medium pH.",
    "Marine seven and RCM three source-supported references are justified individually; fifteen other nominal inputs retain explicit form/process/identity limits. COMPLETE concerns each printed approximate named formula, not lot composition.",
    "Generic Peptone exact MeSH D010461 and generic Soy Peptone exact MICRO181 are supported; named Polypeptone retains its local identity with broader D010461, and specific BD labels remain nonresolving provenance.",
    "An explicit empty rejected Bacto Soytone representative prevents unsafe shared-identifier fallback; it does not choose a new live owner or assert branded/generic equivalence.",
    "Twelve authentic child origins and three existing composites preserve original source-label and preparation scope; five explicit generic inputs now reference direct MeSH Peptones, ten unsupported references remain withdrawn.",
    "All source-specific occurrence, quantity, processing, association, source-admission, role and export holds remain. No guessed chemical identity, owner union, assay requirement or arbitrary winning identifier is introduced."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "This is a report-only scientific proposal review. Root still owns final wrapper/native review persistence and publication; final integration and export acceptance remain separate.",
    "Hash preservation and native validation are mechanical evidence and are not presented as fresh chemistry approval of every155 payload or every188 case.",
    "Historical exact unchanged reviews/captures are reused only with actual attribution. Raw recipe/source rows do not constitute full-text review of every cited publication.",
    "Large quarantined Soy association sets are preserved, not newly adjudicated row by row; explicit shared-owner and source-association holds remain.",
    "Full prior private candidates and initial reviewer judgments, including the stronger assay/use-gate interpretation, remain immutable with this explicit successor qualification.",
    "No new scientific approval of another worker combined owner, no merging and no automatic retirement of their whole-owner review."
  ]
